  repos uncapped on branch unbounded-coordinates-0.4 and the branches landed (rs
  240714d4; py 8c8babcf; node f2f0c2ce; cs ede6292d; C db01e42d; cpp 2412e280 — the cpp
  cap was a uint16_t field silently wrapping 65,535 -> 0, real data loss). Will merged
  rs (published libphext-rs v0.4.0 on crates.io) and py (exo 3b9d45dd, PR #3). The CF
  envelope is CLOSED: IndexedPhext now yields 249,808 distinct coordinates on
  simulations.phext, one per populated scroll. Pre-existing helios failure left
  unrewritten for Will's adjudication; cs compile unverified (no dotnet here).
