  [will_said ruling]: coordinates are 1-based by definition — no
  implementation may emit or hold a component < 1; input values from
  -infinity to 0 are UB (an implementation may wrap them, and NaN,
  to 1). That ruling overrides the rs-parity "null coordinate"
  behaviour node had kept in to_coordinate (CV1/CV2 rewritten; suite
  274 passing at branch HEAD 2b5379ea). Remaining: Will merges the
  branch (register #7), then npm publish.
